# The harness is a development-machine tool. Its dependencies are installed here
# and are not part of the deliverable: nothing in this directory runs on the
# target, because the console's frontend is plain JavaScript embedded in the
# binary, with no build step and no runtime dependency.
#
# Both forms are listed on purpose. A trailing-slash pattern matches a directory
# but NOT a symlink, so "node_modules/" alone would leave a linked node_modules
# visible to git.
node_modules
node_modules/
package-lock.json
